## 🧩 Integration Notes

- Traits can be embedded in NFT metadata for filtering and storytelling.
- Badge tiers unlock new contributor privileges and downloadable kits.
- Figma nodes and Gumdrop packs are linked to Sidekick roles for seamless onboarding.
- Use LiquiEditor modules to embed lore, logic, and emotional resonance.

